  "name": "Convocator Fellowship",
  "type": "feat",
  "effects": [],
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Your companionship grows stronger the longer your pact persists. Your Domain Convocation aura increases to 40 feet. In addition, you gain a new feat to grow your convocator.</p><ul><li><p class=\"Standard\">If your convocator is an animal companion or similar, you gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.3r5rg0BCqSh5RBNS]{Specialized Companion (Druid)} feat (or an equivalent for a different type of companion). You can select this feat up to three times, adding a different specialization to your companion.</p></li><li><p class=\"Standard\">If your convocator is a familiar, your familiar gains your choice of either the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.familiar-abilities.O5TIjqXAuta8iVSz]{Focused Rejuvenation} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.familiar-abilities.asOhEdyF8CWFbR96]{Spellcasting} familiar ability and you gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.familiar-abilities.deC1yIM2S5szGdzT]{Lifelink} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.familiar-abilities.jdlefpPcSCIe27vO]{Familiar Focus} master ability. This selection does not count against your limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"Standard\">If your convocator is an eidolon, you gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.mSDKKRgK6sRMjqQo]{Summoner's Call} feat.</p></li></ul>"
    },
